      "note_text": "<p style=\"background-color:#d9eaf7; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; color:#313132; font-size: 16px; padding: 15px;\">\n\n<b>Filter - Date</b>: Input the date range you want to view results for. Results are currently available for the last completed 24 months.<br>\n\n<b>Filter - Site URL</b>: Input the site URL or URLs if you want to view results for all of the pages of one or more sites. A reminder to input the different versions or spellings of the site URL to capture all results. For example, www.cleanbc.gov.bc.ca and cleanbc.gov.bc.ca are two versions of the site URL for CleanBC.<br>\n\n<b>Filter - Page URL</b>: Input the page URL or URLs if you want to view results for a specific page or pages. A reminder to input the various potential URL spellings. For example, include and not include the \"www\"; include and not include the \"/\" at the end of the URL; etc.<br>\n\n<b>Filter - Marketing Campaign</b>: Input the Marketing Campaign (UTM tracking code) that you want to view results for.<br>\n\n<b>View or Download More Rows/Columns of Data</b>: The current live view limit is 25 rows & 50 columns. To view or download more rows/columns of data, use the \"Advanced data options\" of the \"Download Data\" option. <a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/governments/services-for-government/service-experience-digital-delivery/web-content-development-guides/analytics/download#viewmore\" target=\"_blank\">Go to the online guide for instructions</a>.\n\n\n<br>\n\n</p>",
